WEBVTT

01:50.009 --> 01:53.870
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.270 --> 01:56.870
[Episode 22]

02:02.090 --> 02:07.300
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

02:08.320 --> 02:10.320
♪ Don't rush to wake up ♪

02:10.539 --> 02:14.280
♪ Let the night pass more slowly ♪

02:16.840 --> 02:21.280
♪ Will you stay with me? ♪

02:23.050 --> 02:25.050
♪ Don't ask for why ♪

02:25.700 --> 02:29.000
♪ No need for words, let it be ♪

02:28.840 --> 02:29.770
Where did you go?

02:30.280 --> 02:31.240
You didn't answer my calls.

02:30.880 --> 02:32.710
♪ You won't know ♪

02:32.030 --> 02:33.910
I... I went to get some coins.

02:32.740 --> 02:36.110
♪ I so often feel alone ♪

02:35.030 --> 02:35.630
Well...

02:35.840 --> 02:36.240
I...

02:36.590 --> 02:37.710
I asked the hotel staff,

02:37.710 --> 02:38.470
but they didn't have any.

02:38.230 --> 02:40.630
♪ But watching you ♪

02:38.470 --> 02:39.800
So I thought I'd take...

02:39.800 --> 02:41.400
the shuttle bus down the mountain.

02:40.740 --> 02:44.940
♪ How come I feel solaced ♪

02:41.520 --> 02:43.120
But when I tried to contact you,

02:43.120 --> 02:44.430
my phone died.

02:45.970 --> 02:47.950
♪ Escape the world ♪

02:47.980 --> 02:49.730
♪ Forget all things ♪

02:49.760 --> 02:53.170
♪ Fall into a dream where love's alight ♪

02:53.190 --> 02:55.190
♪ Please hold me tight ♪

02:55.470 --> 02:57.840
♪ Just you and I ♪

02:57.930 --> 03:00.290
♪ Under moonlight ♪

03:00.520 --> 03:03.000
Although I don't know what your wish is,

03:01.150 --> 03:03.230
♪ Away from rush just for a night ♪

03:03.250 --> 03:05.570
♪ Let your passion shine ♪

03:04.120 --> 03:06.430
I hope it comes true
more than anyone else.

03:05.590 --> 03:09.030
♪ Long for joy that's pure and bright ♪

03:10.600 --> 03:15.340
♪ Oh, special night ♪

03:16.400 --> 03:20.700
♪ We will meet tomorrow ♪

03:22.640 --> 03:24.210
♪ I know ♪

03:24.230 --> 03:27.730
♪ Oh, special night ♪

03:27.750 --> 03:30.630
♪ Be with you ♪

03:30.750 --> 03:35.390
♪ Oh, special night ♪

03:38.790 --> 03:39.230
Okay.

03:39.250 --> 03:39.970
I got it.

03:41.150 --> 03:41.880
That's good.

03:43.400 --> 03:44.800
He found her. She's fine.

03:46.240 --> 03:48.240
You must be hungry. Let's eat first.

03:48.670 --> 03:49.390
Hello.

03:53.430 --> 03:55.000
You were in your room all afternoon

03:55.000 --> 03:56.000
and didn't go out?

03:57.670 --> 03:59.670
I was tied up with work.

03:59.690 --> 04:00.660
What about you?

04:01.520 --> 04:02.850
I did a lot of things too.

04:03.430 --> 04:04.080
Like what?

04:04.680 --> 04:06.120
I sat on the terrace,

04:06.440 --> 04:08.440
ate some fruit the hotel delivered,

04:09.030 --> 04:10.310
drank a little wine,

04:10.630 --> 04:11.960
and enjoyed the breeze.

04:13.080 --> 04:15.430
And I cleared out some photos on my phone.

04:19.070 --> 04:20.070
Anyway,

04:20.070 --> 04:21.310
I've never felt as relaxed

04:21.310 --> 04:23.310
as I do today during this whole time.

04:24.510 --> 04:25.120
Alright.

04:25.390 --> 04:26.830
Just for this relaxed mood of yours,

04:26.830 --> 04:28.630
let's have a proper drink later.

04:28.750 --> 04:30.680
I booked some good wine in advance.

04:30.750 --> 04:31.550
Since they are not coming,

04:31.550 --> 04:32.950
it's all for the two of us.

04:33.190 --> 04:34.720
Xiu and Xiao aren't coming?

04:35.170 --> 04:36.830
Xiao just told me on the phone.

04:37.570 --> 04:38.570
Where did they go?

04:45.659 --> 04:46.810
Where are we going?

04:47.870 --> 04:49.530
You'll know when we get there.

05:18.170 --> 05:20.700
How did you know
there's an observation deck?

05:20.720 --> 05:22.050
I looked it up in a guide.

05:25.550 --> 05:28.510
Looks like
Mr. Xiao took this quite seriously.

05:31.480 --> 05:32.270
Actually,

05:32.830 --> 05:34.560
I prepared something else too.

05:35.790 --> 05:36.390
Come here.

05:55.480 --> 05:57.280
You looked this up in a guide too?

06:01.780 --> 06:03.110
Are you still angry now?

06:04.360 --> 06:05.000
Angry?

06:08.600 --> 06:09.520
I'm not angry.

06:10.240 --> 06:11.190
I just...

06:17.950 --> 06:18.950
I was just scared.

06:23.510 --> 06:24.770
When I was very little,

06:25.920 --> 06:28.250
my dad also suddenly disappeared one day.

06:29.510 --> 06:30.640
When I saw him again,

06:31.750 --> 06:33.750
something already happened to him.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.450
That's why I was a bit...

07:03.240 --> 07:03.870
Hu Xiu.

07:05.750 --> 07:06.510
Do you still remember the balloons

07:06.510 --> 07:08.240
that fell on your roof that day?

07:10.160 --> 07:10.870
Yes.

07:13.600 --> 07:14.560
Without you,

07:15.600 --> 07:18.070
I think I'd be like those balloons.

07:18.920 --> 07:20.920
I don't know where I'd have drifted.

07:33.390 --> 07:34.310
So,

07:37.000 --> 07:39.260
don't leave me not knowing where you are.

07:40.790 --> 07:42.520
Let me always be able to see you.

07:46.159 --> 07:47.040
I promise you.

07:48.700 --> 07:51.170
And I will always hold you tight.

09:06.630 --> 09:08.270
What kind of awful wine is this?

09:08.270 --> 09:09.870
It's way too strong.

09:11.670 --> 09:12.320
You...

09:12.650 --> 09:14.600
You drank a whole bottle yourself.

09:15.360 --> 09:16.820
Of course I had to catch up.

09:17.080 --> 09:19.170
But it really is pretty strong.

09:21.130 --> 09:22.560
Are you two doing alright?

09:22.560 --> 09:25.420
This is the free hangover soup
offered by our hotel.

09:25.570 --> 09:26.360
I'm sorry

09:26.360 --> 09:28.360
for causing you trouble yesterday.

09:31.550 --> 09:33.550
-Sorry for the trouble.
-Thank you.

09:43.550 --> 09:44.670
At this hour,

09:44.670 --> 09:46.290
Xiu probably isn't awake yet, right?

09:46.290 --> 09:47.290
Probably not.

09:47.440 --> 09:48.240
What's wrong?

09:49.750 --> 09:51.540
I didn't come back all night.

09:52.870 --> 09:53.870
Why are you feeling guilty?

09:53.870 --> 09:55.630
Are you worried she'll misunderstand us?

09:55.630 --> 09:56.880
Just relax.

09:56.910 --> 09:58.090
How could there be anything between us?

09:58.090 --> 09:59.550
Just hurry back and sleep.

09:59.680 --> 10:01.540
Wait, who's thinking about that?

10:02.240 --> 10:03.630
You haven't even been in a relationship.

10:03.630 --> 10:04.460
You and me—

10:04.490 --> 10:05.720
of course it's impossible.

10:05.720 --> 10:07.030
Why are you bringing this up again?

10:07.030 --> 10:07.510
I...

10:07.510 --> 10:08.510
You little vir...

10:08.810 --> 10:09.610
What...

10:09.960 --> 10:11.360
are you two doing here?

10:18.800 --> 10:20.330
Where did you go last night?

10:21.030 --> 10:22.600
The quilt in the room

10:22.600 --> 10:24.390
was folded neatly.

10:24.390 --> 10:25.850
So where did you go last night?

10:25.850 --> 10:27.910
You slept on the sofa without a quilt?

10:28.530 --> 10:29.560
I won't tell you.

10:29.630 --> 10:30.320
You tell me first.

10:30.320 --> 10:30.720
You tell me.

10:30.720 --> 10:31.790
Where did you two go?

10:31.790 --> 10:32.470
What did you two do?

10:32.470 --> 10:32.960
You tell me.

10:32.960 --> 10:33.510
If you tell me, I'll tell you.

10:33.510 --> 10:34.240
I'm curious. You...

10:34.240 --> 10:34.810
You tell me first.

10:34.810 --> 10:35.950
-You tell me first.
-I won't.

10:35.950 --> 10:36.480
Let's go.

10:45.160 --> 10:47.290
They were gossiping about us just now.

10:47.340 --> 10:48.390
Look at them.

10:48.520 --> 10:49.960
-Why?
-Being all lovey-dovey.

10:49.960 --> 10:51.290
We didn't say anything.

11:52.520 --> 11:53.380
We've arrived?

11:56.010 --> 11:58.340
This is the parking lot in your community.

12:00.530 --> 12:02.200
Driving all day is pretty tiring,

12:02.200 --> 12:03.270
and the fuel is low.

12:03.270 --> 12:04.670
So I drove straight back.

12:05.500 --> 12:06.900
Then rest early.

12:06.930 --> 12:08.130
I'll take a taxi home.

12:10.630 --> 12:11.430
Don't go back.

12:14.080 --> 12:15.280
It's already so late.

12:15.320 --> 12:16.650
Just stay here tonight.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.960
I... I didn't bring my things...

12:19.960 --> 12:21.560
Your luggage is in the trunk.

13:02.180 --> 13:03.780
I'll go get a bottle of water.

13:13.670 --> 13:15.120
Is this still your home?

13:16.510 --> 13:17.200
Last time you came here,

13:17.200 --> 13:18.720
I didn't prepare anything.

13:18.720 --> 13:20.000
So I learned my lesson.

13:21.200 --> 13:21.750
Also,

13:21.840 --> 13:24.200
I noticed
you often have stomach discomfort.

13:24.200 --> 13:26.240
This medicine is good for your stomach.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.700
I wanted to buy it earlier.

13:28.030 --> 13:29.100
And don't drink icy water anymore.

13:29.100 --> 13:31.240
I'll make you a cup
of dark plum and tangerine peel tea.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.080
It's similar to this one.

13:32.080 --> 13:33.510
Both are good for your stomach.

13:33.510 --> 13:34.750
I'll make you something to eat too.

13:34.750 --> 13:36.810
Come out and eat after you freshen up.

13:42.130 --> 13:44.210
Just make something simple.

13:47.780 --> 13:49.310
I'll go put away my luggage.

13:52.720 --> 13:53.510
Um...

13:53.930 --> 13:55.570
I only brought pajamas.

13:55.600 --> 13:57.130
I didn't bring loungewear.

14:00.000 --> 14:01.000
You can wear mine.

14:01.370 --> 14:02.910
There are new ones in the bedroom closet.

14:02.910 --> 14:03.580
Go pick one.

14:42.870 --> 14:44.600
How come I never noticed before

14:44.750 --> 14:46.150
your clothes are this big?

14:46.150 --> 14:47.030
If I walk around the room,

14:47.030 --> 14:48.760
I could mop the floor with them.

14:52.090 --> 14:53.510
There are no fresh vegetables
in the fridge.

14:53.510 --> 14:54.580
Let's make do with what we have.

14:54.580 --> 14:55.100
Come.

15:04.480 --> 15:05.080
Thanks.

15:07.720 --> 15:08.850
Here, wait a second.

15:26.780 --> 15:28.210
Why aren't you eating?

15:29.720 --> 15:30.580
I'm not hungry.

15:32.000 --> 15:33.050
I'm not hungry either,

15:33.050 --> 15:34.330
but eat with me anyway.

15:53.690 --> 15:55.240
What dishes would you like tomorrow?

15:55.240 --> 15:56.170
I'll go buy them.

15:59.140 --> 16:00.740
Stay here for a few more days.

16:08.360 --> 16:08.840
Why...

16:10.150 --> 16:13.190
Why... Why are we suddenly...

16:13.240 --> 16:14.200
g-going to...

16:15.040 --> 16:15.470
I...

16:15.490 --> 16:16.940
We are already together.

16:17.270 --> 16:18.800
So what if we live together?

16:19.280 --> 16:20.210
Don't you agree?

16:27.060 --> 16:27.670
Why do I feel

16:27.670 --> 16:29.800
you inviting me here today was a setup?

16:30.680 --> 16:32.510
I just don't want to be apart from you.

16:32.510 --> 16:33.240
No setup.

16:44.840 --> 16:46.720
So Mr. Xiao, when you're in love,

16:46.840 --> 16:47.970
you're this clingy.

17:49.750 --> 17:50.550
Where is he?

17:55.920 --> 17:56.880
You're here.

17:58.200 --> 17:59.120
Are you sleepy?

17:59.670 --> 18:02.000
If you've freshened up, go to sleep first.

18:02.550 --> 18:03.510
What's wrong?

18:04.200 --> 18:05.350
What happened?

18:07.160 --> 18:07.810
Nothing.

18:07.840 --> 18:09.300
Just work-related stuff.

18:09.680 --> 18:10.590
Don't wait for me.

18:10.590 --> 18:11.510
Go rest first.

18:12.660 --> 18:14.050
Don't stay up too late.

18:26.020 --> 18:27.540
He asked me to stay,

18:28.300 --> 18:29.830
but he's busy with work now.

20:08.400 --> 20:09.200
You're awake.

20:10.880 --> 20:13.280
You've already washed up and gotten ready?

20:14.250 --> 20:15.780
I haven't brushed my teeth.

20:15.860 --> 20:16.580
It's okay.

20:18.220 --> 20:19.020
Fine.

20:22.040 --> 20:22.970
I made breakfast.

20:22.970 --> 20:24.370
Eat before you go to work.

20:25.400 --> 20:26.000
By the way,

20:26.350 --> 20:26.960
later,

20:26.960 --> 20:28.700
I'll register your fingerprint.

20:28.700 --> 20:30.320
I need to go out
to handle some things today,

20:30.320 --> 20:31.680
so I can't drive you to the company.

20:31.680 --> 20:33.280
I'll call a car for you later.

20:34.440 --> 20:36.040
After work, come back first.

20:36.350 --> 20:37.410
I'll be back later.

20:38.280 --> 20:39.760
You'll be busy all day?

20:41.240 --> 20:43.040
Is it something very important?

20:45.960 --> 20:46.650
Alright.

20:56.510 --> 20:57.070
Mr. Pei.

20:57.750 --> 20:58.350
Come in.

20:59.880 --> 21:00.920
During the morning meeting today,

21:00.920 --> 21:02.650
I noticed you didn't look well.

21:02.980 --> 21:04.710
You should take some medicine.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.520
Leave it here.

21:11.400 --> 21:11.880
Mr. Pei.

21:13.750 --> 21:17.510
Chairman doesn't want you involved
in the company's financial matters.

21:17.510 --> 21:18.880
Why go against him?

21:25.590 --> 21:27.850
I'm the general manager of this company.

21:28.400 --> 21:30.060
What happened to the company,

21:30.400 --> 21:32.400
how many things he's hiding from me—

21:33.070 --> 21:34.030
I need to know.

21:35.200 --> 21:37.260
I need to think of ways to handle them.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.810
Over the past 6 months,

21:40.270 --> 21:42.600
the entire industry has been struggling.

21:43.110 --> 21:44.380
The current situation at Forma

21:44.380 --> 21:45.580
isn't your fault.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.840
I must protect Forma.

21:54.160 --> 21:54.960
After all...

22:03.540 --> 22:04.140
What's up?

22:05.000 --> 22:06.160
Someone at reception wants to see Mr. Pei,

22:06.160 --> 22:08.360
saying she's here to return a lunchbox.

22:09.310 --> 22:09.790
Mr. Pei,

22:10.350 --> 22:13.010
reception said
someone brought you a lunchbox.

22:17.010 --> 22:18.110
Tell her to wait for me.

22:18.110 --> 22:19.840
I'll be downstairs right away.

22:59.270 --> 23:00.270
Mr. Xiao, it seems your workload

23:00.270 --> 23:02.000
still isn't saturated enough.

23:02.270 --> 23:05.130
You still have time
to run errands for someone else.

23:07.440 --> 23:10.100
Using returning something
as an excuse to meet—

23:10.160 --> 23:11.200
Mr. Pei, this little trick of yours

23:11.200 --> 23:12.460
can't be more obvious.

23:15.440 --> 23:16.640
Your plan failed,

23:16.660 --> 23:17.810
so now you're angry?

23:24.590 --> 23:27.190
Tell your father
to stop investigating Hu Xiu.

23:31.080 --> 23:31.710
What?

23:32.550 --> 23:35.480
These past few days,
someone has been tailing Hu Xiu.

23:35.630 --> 23:37.810
From the studio to the area near her home,

23:37.810 --> 23:40.340
her movements
have been under surveillance.

23:41.450 --> 23:43.380
What makes you say my father did it?

23:43.880 --> 23:45.310
A black Buick sedan,

23:45.470 --> 23:47.190
with the plate ending BF69H.

23:47.610 --> 23:48.350
If you don't believe me,

23:48.350 --> 23:49.880
you can check for yourself.

23:52.790 --> 23:53.790
Actually, this isn't the first time

23:53.790 --> 23:55.470
your father has done something like this.

23:55.470 --> 23:56.730
Back when I was abroad,

23:57.620 --> 23:59.480
right after I left the Pei family,

24:00.440 --> 24:02.240
there were his eyes watching me.

24:09.750 --> 24:11.270
I warned you before:

24:12.720 --> 24:13.590
don't make Hu Xiu

24:13.590 --> 24:15.320
pay for your wishful thinking.

24:18.350 --> 24:19.550
Those things you did for her—

24:19.550 --> 24:22.210
for now, I believe
you did them out of sincerity.

24:22.310 --> 24:23.160
But now,

24:23.810 --> 24:25.540
you've seen the consequences.

24:28.920 --> 24:30.380
Please stay away from her.

24:36.580 --> 24:38.050
I will protect her.

24:45.480 --> 24:46.550
Facing him—

24:49.330 --> 24:50.170
do you dare?

25:11.590 --> 25:12.200
Mr. Pei,

25:13.590 --> 25:14.240
can you...

25:14.870 --> 25:16.130
please say something?

25:16.860 --> 25:18.660
What should... What should I do?

25:19.640 --> 25:22.570
Follow
the regulatory department's requirements.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.830
Since the factory's emissions
exceed standards,

25:24.830 --> 25:26.470
the report against you is justified.

25:26.470 --> 25:27.400
Just rectify it.

25:28.920 --> 25:29.510
Well,

25:30.830 --> 25:33.160
I'm not worried about the rectification.

25:33.180 --> 25:34.790
For this order,

25:34.810 --> 25:36.570
I mortgaged everything I own.

25:36.600 --> 25:37.790
I took bank loans

25:38.030 --> 25:39.380
to buy equipment and expand production.

25:39.380 --> 25:39.860
I...

25:42.080 --> 25:43.940
I even borrowed from loan sharks.

25:45.160 --> 25:45.880
So...

25:46.480 --> 25:48.080
So if the factory stops production,

25:48.080 --> 25:49.480
the order falls through.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.870
How am I supposed
to pay back such a huge sum?

25:52.870 --> 25:55.070
Such a big piece of meat was given to you,

25:55.150 --> 25:57.550
put right at your lips,
and you still starve?

25:57.550 --> 25:58.200
I... I...

25:59.310 --> 25:59.920
Mr. Pei,

26:00.640 --> 26:03.000
there's a loan shark debt due soon.

26:03.110 --> 26:05.030
Can you please show some mercy?

26:05.030 --> 26:06.830
I've supported you for 20 years.

26:07.920 --> 26:09.070
Even a dog

26:09.960 --> 26:12.160
should learn to find its own food by now.

26:19.920 --> 26:20.600
Mr. Pei.

26:22.750 --> 26:24.350
You... really...

26:24.670 --> 26:26.000
can't refuse to help me.

26:29.200 --> 26:30.060
Of course I can.

26:39.720 --> 26:41.110
Aren't you worried I'll...

26:41.110 --> 26:42.310
Worried you'll what?

26:44.440 --> 26:46.070
What happened 20 years ago—

26:46.390 --> 26:46.920
I've always...

26:46.920 --> 26:48.250
Are you threatening me?

26:50.200 --> 26:51.350
Just with your made-up story,

26:51.350 --> 26:53.010
you think you can threaten me?

26:53.160 --> 26:54.240
Did I make it up?

26:55.230 --> 26:56.030
Pei Kanghua,

26:56.570 --> 26:58.090
you'd better not push me!

26:58.240 --> 26:58.970
Show him out!

27:06.000 --> 27:06.640
Mr. Huang,

27:07.350 --> 27:07.960
please.

27:10.000 --> 27:11.110
If you won't leave,

27:11.390 --> 27:13.320
I can have security escort you out.

27:14.480 --> 27:15.200
From now on,

27:16.230 --> 27:18.230
don't let this person come in again.

27:18.400 --> 27:18.920
Yes.

27:21.750 --> 27:22.270
Please.

27:39.170 --> 27:40.430
Mr. Pei, what's wrong?

27:42.680 --> 27:43.480
Mr. Pei! Mr. Pei!

27:43.480 --> 27:44.200
Get out of my way!

27:44.200 --> 27:45.110
Wait, Mr. Pei!

27:45.420 --> 27:45.940
Mr. Pei!

27:51.810 --> 27:53.010
I'm sorry, Chairman.

27:55.520 --> 27:57.650
Why did you send people to watch Hu Xiu?

27:58.030 --> 27:59.690
How did you find out about her?

27:59.750 --> 28:00.810
Was it Xiao Wanyue?

28:00.890 --> 28:02.350
What nonsense did she say?

28:04.620 --> 28:05.830
She is your elder.

28:07.880 --> 28:09.810
Don't you even know basic manners?

28:12.720 --> 28:14.280
What you do every day,

28:14.310 --> 28:15.200
who you meet—

28:15.640 --> 28:17.370
is there anything I don't know?

28:17.940 --> 28:19.400
Do I need others to tell me?

28:41.440 --> 28:42.200
Hu Xiu...

28:43.510 --> 28:44.920
has nothing to do with me.

28:46.070 --> 28:47.800
It's just my wishful thinking.

28:48.590 --> 28:49.240
Dad,

28:50.410 --> 28:52.740
can you stop sending people to bother her?

28:53.630 --> 28:54.970
Do you think I'm putting on some act

28:54.970 --> 28:56.370
to break you two up?

28:57.570 --> 28:59.880
You and that girl Hu Xiu
have been in contact

28:59.880 --> 29:01.160
for quite some time.

29:02.310 --> 29:03.590
Do you really not know

29:04.270 --> 29:05.600
who her father is?

29:18.460 --> 29:19.390
Too careless.

29:27.560 --> 29:31.720
[Forma Group]

29:27.740 --> 29:28.910
Are you blind?

29:51.590 --> 29:52.310
Hu Xiu.

31:06.600 --> 31:08.230
Much cuter than now.

31:55.360 --> 31:56.360
You're back!

31:57.710 --> 31:59.510
I haven't seen you all day.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.710
How was your day?

32:02.970 --> 32:04.370
Was your commute smooth?

32:05.380 --> 32:06.940
I took taxis both ways.

32:07.110 --> 32:08.320
Of course it was smooth.

32:08.320 --> 32:10.320
It's just that the fare is a bit high.

32:10.440 --> 32:11.840
I'll drive you tomorrow.

32:12.070 --> 32:13.200
Have you had dinner?

32:13.640 --> 32:14.310
No.

32:14.880 --> 32:15.680
I'm at your place,

32:15.680 --> 32:17.740
so of course I'm freeloading off you.

32:17.790 --> 32:19.250
I want to eat what you cook.

32:21.000 --> 32:21.720
I bought groceries.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.980
They're in the fridge.

32:24.790 --> 32:26.520
So that's what you really want.

32:27.110 --> 32:27.710
By the way,

32:27.830 --> 32:29.830
I also bought quite a few things.

32:30.160 --> 32:31.440
Just daily necessities and such.

32:31.440 --> 32:32.700
You don't mind, do you?

32:32.960 --> 32:34.220
Of course I don't mind.

32:34.650 --> 32:36.710
I like that you make yourself at home.

32:37.840 --> 32:38.880
And I like...

32:39.260 --> 32:41.390
that I can see you as soon as I come home.

32:45.880 --> 32:48.160
I meant for you to carry me.

32:48.750 --> 32:51.480
I forgot to put on slippers
when I came in just now.

32:54.680 --> 32:55.210
Let's go!

32:55.220 --> 32:56.870
Go to the kitchen to order!

32:59.240 --> 33:00.640
Find the slippers first.

33:04.000 --> 33:05.400
Where are your slippers?

33:05.840 --> 33:07.640
I... I remember I put them here.

33:09.590 --> 33:10.240
Where?

33:11.070 --> 33:13.070
Are they... Are they under the sofa?

33:13.470 --> 33:14.530
You're fooling me?

33:16.790 --> 33:18.520
That's exactly what I'm doing.

33:19.090 --> 33:20.420
You're fooling me, huh?

33:20.440 --> 33:21.770
You're fooling me, huh?

33:21.790 --> 33:23.070
No tickling. No tickling!

33:23.070 --> 33:24.130
Are you fooling me?

33:24.160 --> 33:24.750
Are you?

33:25.880 --> 33:26.960
Who told you to come back so late?

33:26.960 --> 33:27.560
Come here.

33:28.160 --> 33:28.680
Go.

33:28.680 --> 33:29.550
Go cook.

33:29.920 --> 33:30.960
I'm starving.

33:31.240 --> 33:32.440
Come here. Don't run.

33:33.110 --> 33:34.400
Hurry, I'm getting hypoglycemic.

33:34.400 --> 33:35.030
Come here.

33:35.110 --> 33:36.260
I'm really dizzy right now.

33:36.260 --> 33:37.520
I need to eat. Let's go.

33:56.790 --> 33:58.520
What are you doing in the study?

33:58.830 --> 34:00.000
I asked you to live here,

34:00.000 --> 34:01.240
not to work overtime.

34:03.270 --> 34:04.920
I came to put up a photo.

34:07.740 --> 34:10.000
A photo taken when we were out having fun?

34:14.510 --> 34:15.960
While I was tidying up,

34:15.960 --> 34:17.320
I saw this photo

34:18.110 --> 34:19.770
and thought it needed a frame.

34:20.590 --> 34:22.280
So I ordered one online.

34:22.590 --> 34:24.590
I didn't expect it to arrive so fast.

34:37.590 --> 34:39.719
With a frame,

34:39.739 --> 34:42.090
the photo can be preserved longer.

34:43.840 --> 34:45.000
So it's okay

34:45.219 --> 34:46.300
to display it.

34:47.590 --> 34:48.590
What do you think?

34:51.230 --> 34:52.190
Just put it here.

34:53.960 --> 34:54.960
I think

34:55.460 --> 34:57.190
you look a lot like your father.

34:57.910 --> 34:59.070
Not just in looks—

34:59.960 --> 35:02.030
you even have a similar style.

35:08.070 --> 35:09.280
When you have time,

35:10.110 --> 35:12.030
tell me about your dad.

35:16.360 --> 35:16.880
Okay.

35:19.150 --> 35:20.440
But there's no rush.

35:21.030 --> 35:22.830
Whenever you feel like talking,

35:23.590 --> 35:24.320
I'll be here.

35:54.280 --> 35:55.960
Mr. Xiao,
a friend of yours is here to see you.

35:55.960 --> 35:58.020
I asked him to wait in the lounge area.

36:04.630 --> 36:05.230
Mr. Xiao.

36:07.380 --> 36:08.710
What are you doing here?

36:09.990 --> 36:12.050
It's about the new instance dungeon.

36:12.070 --> 36:14.190
You haven't been at the club for days.

36:14.310 --> 36:15.980
I didn't dare go to your home,

36:17.040 --> 36:19.290
worried there might be a girl there.

36:21.230 --> 36:22.110
Get to the point.

36:22.110 --> 36:23.490
I have a meeting this afternoon.

36:23.490 --> 36:26.220
Your big project is already settled.

36:26.630 --> 36:28.030
Why are you still so busy?

36:28.480 --> 36:29.230
Listen,

36:29.470 --> 36:31.200
ignoring the collaboration event
is one thing.

36:31.200 --> 36:33.460
But now you're not even playing anymore.

36:33.480 --> 36:34.320
Even without me there,

36:34.320 --> 36:36.250
doesn't everything run just fine?

36:36.250 --> 36:37.480
That's not the same.

36:38.110 --> 36:38.760
Xiao,

36:39.590 --> 36:40.710
regarding the club matters,

36:40.710 --> 36:42.770
you still need to make the decisions.

36:42.920 --> 36:43.480
Recently, the collaboration event

36:43.480 --> 36:43.880
with Regard Café

36:43.880 --> 36:44.630
has been

36:44.630 --> 36:45.830
well received, right?

36:45.830 --> 36:46.790
So I'm thinking,

36:46.840 --> 36:49.400
if we introduce a new instance dungeon
in the second half of the year,

36:49.400 --> 36:51.000
should we try something new?

36:51.960 --> 36:52.840
You decide.

36:53.410 --> 36:55.740
You'll be in charge of the club
from now on.

36:56.400 --> 36:56.960
Wait.

36:58.480 --> 36:58.920
I...

36:59.320 --> 37:00.320
I'll be in charge?

37:01.150 --> 37:01.670
Then...

37:01.960 --> 37:03.070
you're not getting involved anymore?

37:03.070 --> 37:04.000
What do you mean?

37:04.670 --> 37:05.550
I...

37:06.420 --> 37:07.850
plan to step back from the club

37:07.850 --> 37:08.850
and stop playing.

37:09.670 --> 37:10.400
Wait, wait.

37:12.360 --> 37:13.960
Don't... Don't joke with me.

37:14.430 --> 37:16.630
You... You're just quitting like that?

37:16.710 --> 37:17.630
If you quit,

37:17.630 --> 37:18.400
what am I supposed to do?

37:18.400 --> 37:20.200
The club will lose its backbone.

37:21.210 --> 37:22.280
After running it for so long,

37:22.280 --> 37:23.550
haven't you realized

37:23.950 --> 37:25.810
you're the backbone of this club?

37:26.210 --> 37:28.370
I only handled design-related stuff.

37:29.110 --> 37:30.480
Besides, the operations

37:30.480 --> 37:31.490
are basically stable now.

37:31.490 --> 37:32.300
You can do it.

37:33.480 --> 37:34.440
But...

37:35.670 --> 37:36.150
your...

37:36.510 --> 37:38.320
your decision is too sudden.

37:41.190 --> 37:42.320
Before, playing as an NPC

37:42.320 --> 37:44.120
was just a way to relieve stress.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.670
But now...

37:50.550 --> 37:51.440
Qin Xiaoyi

37:52.070 --> 37:54.530
shouldn't be trapped in Rongcheng anymore.

38:00.710 --> 38:01.510
Alright then.

38:02.320 --> 38:04.050
Since you've made up your mind,

38:04.290 --> 38:06.040
I won't say more.

38:07.510 --> 38:09.110
Give me some time to prepare.

38:10.590 --> 38:11.280
Mr. Xiao.

38:12.230 --> 38:13.070
Zhiyu,

38:13.320 --> 38:14.980
you haven't had lunch, right?

38:16.090 --> 38:16.740
Mom.

38:19.230 --> 38:20.230
Hello, Mrs. Xiao.

38:21.480 --> 38:22.480
You are...

38:22.480 --> 38:23.540
I'm Gong Huaicong,

38:23.550 --> 38:25.480
Xiao Zhiyu's classmate in the U.S.

38:25.490 --> 38:26.970
We met at graduation.

38:28.880 --> 38:30.590
I came to deliver some food.

38:30.910 --> 38:32.330
You can eat together later.

38:32.330 --> 38:33.860
Okay. Thank you, Mrs. Xiao.

38:34.360 --> 38:35.000
Zhiyu,

38:35.020 --> 38:36.460
the soup you loved last time—

38:36.460 --> 38:37.780
I made some more.

38:38.510 --> 38:40.440
And I brought some side dishes too.

38:41.550 --> 38:42.670
She came to see you.

38:42.910 --> 38:43.770
Were you happy?

38:44.630 --> 38:45.550
I think...

38:46.070 --> 38:47.480
I was happy.

38:48.190 --> 38:50.550
Then don't hide what you think.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.400
That way, others will know

38:52.400 --> 38:53.510
what you like,

38:53.840 --> 38:54.590
what you need,

38:54.590 --> 38:55.790
and what you hope for.

38:55.980 --> 38:58.040
As long as the other person cares too,

38:58.120 --> 39:00.520
your relationship can be rebuilt quickly.

39:04.440 --> 39:05.320
Thanks, Mom.

39:06.820 --> 39:07.530
Xiao.

39:08.550 --> 39:09.550
Your mom is so good to you.

39:09.550 --> 39:11.410
I can smell it even with the lid on.

39:15.500 --> 39:17.300
I'll take this over there first.

39:20.800 --> 39:21.550
Zhiyu,

39:21.630 --> 39:23.500
do you remember our neighbor in the U.S.,

39:23.500 --> 39:24.540
Mr. Wu?

39:24.650 --> 39:26.380
His family came to Shanghai.

39:27.020 --> 39:29.320
They want
to get both our families together.

39:29.320 --> 39:30.280
Especially you—

39:30.390 --> 39:32.590
you haven't seen them for years, right?

39:33.630 --> 39:35.760
I haven't seen them since graduation.

39:36.990 --> 39:39.720
Zhen now has someone he likes.

39:39.930 --> 39:41.790
I also hope you'll have a companion

39:41.790 --> 39:43.140
by your side soon.

39:44.000 --> 39:46.670
Luna went to high school with you,

39:47.170 --> 39:48.430
and you got along well.

39:48.820 --> 39:50.760
You know each other's backgrounds,
and you were neighbors.

39:50.760 --> 39:53.360
You should contact her more
when you have time.

39:56.360 --> 39:56.920
Alright.

39:57.070 --> 39:57.880
Mom, I got it.

39:59.320 --> 40:00.070
Um...

40:00.070 --> 40:02.800
Mr. Wu's family
is staying at Meilai Hotel.

40:02.990 --> 40:04.070
Tomorrow evening,

40:04.300 --> 40:07.010
we'll have dinner in a private room
on the second floor.

40:07.010 --> 40:08.530
Come if you're free.

40:10.940 --> 40:12.340
I'll be going now.

40:13.110 --> 40:14.040
You stay seated.

40:14.140 --> 40:15.340
Take care, Mrs. Xiao.

40:15.360 --> 40:16.360
I'll walk you out.

40:29.760 --> 40:30.230
This...

40:30.630 --> 40:31.630
Stop pretending.

40:34.070 --> 40:34.630
Um...

40:34.630 --> 40:35.190
Luna...

40:35.190 --> 40:36.120
Shut your mouth.

40:37.070 --> 40:37.930
Let me tell you.

40:38.280 --> 40:39.080
Don't mention

40:39.090 --> 40:40.950
a single word about this to Hu Xiu.

40:41.950 --> 40:42.540
Yes, sir.
